  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the pork belly into slice
  - Chop the pork liver into slice
  - Chop the green chili into slice
  - Chop the garlic into minced
  - Chop the onion into sliced
  - Chop the ginger into sliced
  - Turn the stove high heat.
  - Put the pan in the stove.
  - 'Add water '
  - Place the pork belly in the pan
  - Place the pork liver in the pan
  - Add the chopped ginger
  - Add the garlic
  - Add the onion
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Saute the pan
  - Add the seasoned pork blood
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Stir the pan
  - Add the green chillies
  - Add bay leaf
  - Put the pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1 tsp of vinegar
  - Add 1 tsp of salt
